The community bundle remains the single implementation of management services,
RPC, original components and update checking. This package decorates registered
React output and retains native-shell.css and the existing local tool policy.
The startup timeout adapter preserves existing startupTimeoutMs on export.
Since 0.1.2 it rejects timeout-bearing edits before any write: upstream 1.12.0
reads insert rows only, so writing native overrides would leave stale views;
normalizing raw expression objects could also corrupt stored references.
Use DSH native configuration editing for those connections.
